20.NOV.13
TO: CCA, CCE, CCB, NSG, WSG, USG, ASG
FM: CDA
RE: [SQM] YR2014 Yearly Sales QTA Establishing - Day1

Dear recipients,
we always appreciate your efforts and supports.
As you can see below, from today we start to establish our YR2014 Yearly Sales QTA.

[cid:E5A8.jpg@12345678.87654321]


For "Data Management" setting period, we will guide you (Head office & RHQs) daily for your daily subject to check and update.
Once you complete your daily subject, please reply us about it.
(When you reply us don't reply all. If needed, please include your orgazination's members only.)

[cid:89E0.jpg@12345678.87654321]

So for day1, QTA PICs of each Head office and RHQ should check above screen's highlighted menus only.
Basically, each screen will have initial data. So first please check existing data.
And if there is anything need to be adjusted, please fix and save them in the screen.
Since those screens have only basic data you can finish it within few seconds.

Without SSC teams and RHQs confirmation for Day1 work, we can't move on to Day2 subject tomorrow.
(Day2 work: Head Office => None
                RHQ => "Lane Office Relaton Setting" (which will use "Lane Master" &  "RHQ Office Mapping" data)
So please don't delay your Day1 work.

Lastly, let us know your ID if you are the QTA PIC and you still don't have access right to SQM.
And feel free to contact us anytime if you have any question about this work & other QTA related things.
Please refer detail work guidance by downloading below linked files.

:)



*Links: User Guidance (HO & RHQ respectively)

        => Head Office Link (Click here for downloading HO Guudance)<http://mail.hanjin.com/pds/pds_url_pre_download.jsp?key=NTI4NDhiNDczZmUwNDAzYjU5NGUyY2Vj&lang=kor>

        => RHQ (Click here for downloading RHQ Guudance)<http://mail.hanjin.com/pds/pds_url_pre_download.jsp?key=NTI4NDhiNjkzZmRkOWYwNWM4MDgzMWI4&lang=kor>


-End-

